editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md:331:## 9. The record passages: exact limits
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-332-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md:333:- **The leaf is read aloud once**, by Karis, in the chamber, on the 293rd morning (M6). It is not quoted again by anyone who heard it. Cael gives Lira the page to read; nobody says it back.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-334-- **"Four hundred years"** appears only in the record's voice (the leaf's head, given in Karis's single paraphrase) and at the fixed positions: Cael's pole-two sentence, the 298th log, the 305th close dialogue and the closing prose. Do not add uses.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-335-- **"The Architect"** is the record's **title** ("a title, not a name; the name's gone"). After the leaf it appears again only as a historical comparison ("as old as the Architect"). Nobody uses it as a present agent.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-336-- **The chronicle's hole stays a hole.** "Marked." There is no gloss, guess or second source.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-337-- **The un-bound / [UNBOUND]:** the word is live as a historical *kind* in the leaf. Before that, Karis uses it once as a stratum limit ("Older than [UNBOUND]") at Cleon's table.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-338-- **Two pages, no line.** The leaf and the lamps finding are never joined: not in dialogue, not in any interior (including cutaways), not in the narration. Vastin's sentence stops twice (in the chamber; on the shale). The words *terminal*, *circuit* and *infrastructure* are never used for Arbiters.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-339-- **The deep-layer sheet:** "Sequence initiated … Correlated with classification event —" and the bar. Only Cael and Seln do the sum. Neither says or writes it. Nobody interprets the sequence.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/BOOK_MAP.md-340-
